# Line endings: everything text is LF in the repository AND in the working tree, on every platform.
# The framework's scripts run on Linux clusters (bash and sbatch refuse CR), tools/deploy_shared.sh
# refuses to publish CR files, and the framework tests check for CR. Without this file a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true would turn them all into CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.tpl text eol=lf
*.sbatch text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
framework/bin/hpcworker text eol=lf
framework/VERSION text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
